From eb7776e49cb727a518d671b9b51b344a67087c51 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HuJK <s920361@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 16 Jul 2026 15:37:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 4/5] virtio-gpu: take the blob dma-buf import path even with
 virgl 3D

Upstream bails out of the guest-blob dma-buf import path whenever the
device has virgl 3D, falling back to drm_gem_prime_import(). DroidVM
needs external dma-bufs imported as guest blobs with 3D enabled so the
imported pages stay reachable for the Gunyah memparcel/BAR mapping flow.

This change shipped in the droidvm-guest-additions DKMS tree from the
start but was missing from the exported patch series (found while
regenerating the series against the pristine Ubuntu base); this commit
formalizes it so base + patches reproduces the shipped driver exactly.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/virtio/virtgpu_prime.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/virtio/virtgpu_prime.c b/drivers/gpu/drm/virtio/virtgpu_prime.c
index 8adcf5c..05756ed 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/virtio/virtgpu_prime.c
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/virtio/virtgpu_prime.c
@@ -310,7 +310,7 @@ struct drm_gem_object *virtgpu_gem_prime_import(struct drm_device *dev,
 		}
 	}
 
-	if (!vgdev->has_resource_blob || vgdev->has_virgl_3d)
+	if (!vgdev->has_resource_blob)
 		return drm_gem_prime_import(dev, buf);
 
 	bo = kzalloc_obj(*bo);
